{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16852","headline":"送惟详律师自越之义兴 · 崔子向","name":"送惟详律师自越之义兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阳羡诸峰顶，何曾异剡山。\n雨晴人到寺，木落夜开关。\n缝衲纱灯亮，看心锡杖闲。\n西方知有社，未得与师还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔子向","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16852.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16852","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}